# The image carries what serves a visitor and nothing else.
#
# data/ is the reason this file matters rather than being tidiness: raw/ is
# gigabytes of downloads and none of it reaches a deploy. The editor emits
# `blocks` configs whose load shape is inline, so the served scenario needs no
# data file at all.

.git
.gitignore
.venv
.vscode
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.env

data/
runs/
notebooks/
tests/

# The browser-run check pages. They exercise the frontend against fixtures and
# have no place on a public URL.
web/check-*.html
